                <pb facs="0784" n="702" sameAs="frus:frus1911/pg702"/>

                <head>Extradition treaty between the United States and Salvador</head>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#italic">Signed at San Salvador, April 18,
                        1911; ratification advised by the Senate, May 22, 1911; ratified by the
                        President, June 8, 1911; ratified by Salvador, May 11, 1911; ratifications
                        exchanged at San Salvador, July 10, 1911; proclaimed, July 18.
                    1911.</hi></p>

